      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2623 released prior year reserves of $42.6 million in 2022. This net release was primarily driven by favorable development on MAP Risks and Property Risks divisions, partially offset by strengthening on the Cyber Risks division for the 2020 underwriting year. The 2020 year of account was impacted by COVID-19 losses and natural catastrophes like Hurricanes Ida, Laura, and Storm Uri, while the 2021 year of account was affected by the war in Ukraine and natural catastrophes including Ida, Laura, and Uri. Despite these impacts, portfolio diversification and careful risk selection contributed to the overall release.",
